name    mod-dungeon-challenge: a full boss clear of Turtle Hateforge Quarry (808) completes the run
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Hateforge Quarry is staged `enabled = 0` in dungeon_challenge_dungeons with
# boss_count 4; this checks the boss list (dungeon_challenge_boss_entry plus rank 3) before it is enabled: the
# director kills every listed boss with `.die` in a level-1 run (uplift 80); the run must end cleared, with every kill
# credited. `.dchallenge start` only knows enabled dungeons: the test window sets `enabled = 1` and restarts, and a
# dungeon whose scenario fails goes back to `enabled = 0`.
timeout 300s

bot a warrior
group party

place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
require a alive
as gm .cheat god on
as gm .dchallenge start 808 1
expect output has "starting"
waitfor gm map 808 timeout 20s
wait 2s

log boss 1 - hate (930095)
do gm goto -7990.6 -3581.7 112.4
wait 2s
pick hate creature:930095 near gm
require hate exists
do gm target hate
as gm .die
waitfor hate dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 2 - bargul (930096)
do gm goto -8304.9 -3442.2 195.4
wait 2s
pick bargul creature:930096 near gm
require bargul exists
do gm target bargul
as gm .die
waitfor bargul dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 3 - figgles (930097)
do gm goto -8119.5 -3462.5 171.6
wait 2s
pick figgles creature:930097 near gm
require figgles exists
do gm target figgles
as gm .die
waitfor figgles dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 4 - hargesh (930098)
do gm goto -8307.3 -3741.5 138.9
wait 2s
pick hargesh creature:930098 near gm
require hargesh exists
do gm target hargesh
as gm .die
waitfor hargesh dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log the run ended cleared with every boss credited
as gm .dchallenge status
expect output has "bosses 4/4"
expect output has "state 7"

cleanup
as gm .cheat god off
place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
